### 4.3 Finding Fingerprint (Change #6)

```python
fingerprint = sha256(
    f"{rule_id}:{file_path}:{normalize_whitespace(code_snippet)}"
).hexdigest()
```

Used to track `new` / `existing` / `fixed` status across consecutive scans of the same repo without re-running full deduplication.

### 4.4 Security Score Formula (Change #21)

```
score = max(0,
  100
  - (critical_count × 10)
  - (high_count    × 5)
  - (medium_count  × 2)
  - (low_count     × 0.5)
)
```

Computed at scan completion and stored in `scans.security_score`.

